WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
I’m excited to announce that
preorders are now open

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:10.800
for my How Not to Age Cookbook,
which will be out April 22!

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.960
The cookbook is filled with
more than 100 recipes

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:16.200
developed in conjunction with
the great Robin Robertson.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.760
Not only is every recipe
health-promoting,

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:22.600
but every ingredient of every
recipe is health-promoting.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:23.386
Wait!

00:00:23.386 --> 00:00:24.640
How do you make things
sweet without sugar,

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:25.560
salty without salt?

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:27.640
Those are some of the
challenges we faced

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:30.080
to come up with
delicious recipes

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:32.320
focusing on some of the
healthiest of healthy foods,

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:36.480
even in those Blue Zone longevity
regions around the world.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:39.836
Find out more at
nutritionfacts.org/books

00:00:39.836 --> 00:00:40.800
and as always,

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:43.000
all proceeds I receive from
the sales of all of my books

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.680
are all donated to charity directly,

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:51.033
to make you and the
world a better place.

